          "end": 303,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:0",
          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "In the construction of this code and of all ordinances and resolutions passed by the City Council, the rules set out in this section shall be observed and the definitions prescribed in this section shall apply, unless such construction would be inconsistent with the manifest intent of the City Council.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "bec7a3fa-4eb2-5a56-8ad1-621fab27ab14",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 419,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:1",
          "start": 304
        },
        "quote": "Advisory Board of Health. The words “Advisory Board of Health” shall mean the City-County Advisory Board of Health.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "fb507f40-bd54-5641-8017-543394c59fe7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 497,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:2",
          "start": 420
        },
        "quote": "Bond. When a bond is required, an undertaking in writing shall be sufficient.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "ca884f12-0678-5b0b-862a-b647837c06e0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 620,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:3",
          "start": 498
        },
        "quote": "City. The words “the City” or “this City” shall mean the City of Topeka, in the County of Shawnee, in the State of Kansas.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "18998365-281b-5ea5-9813-535896a6fef7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 821,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:4",
          "start": 621
        },
        "quote": "City Officers, Departments, Etc. Whenever reference is made to an officer, department, council\nor other agency, the same shall be construed as if followed by the words “of the City of Topeka, Kansas.”",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "5ef35746-1f64-5a73-9310-c427fffb6546",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 901,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:5",
          "start": 822
        },
        "quote": "Code. The term “code” or “this code” shall mean the code of the City of Topeka.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "3ec011e5-3f8b-59f7-9b71-dd5e61e71044",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1093,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:6",
          "start": 902
        },
        "quote": "Computation of Time. The time within which an act is to be done shall be computed by excluding the first and including the last day; and if the last day is Sunday, that day shall be excluded.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "d048661e-6c1b-5063-b316-afd58cb16e3c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1176,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:7",
          "start": 1094
        },
        "quote": "County. The words “the County” mean the County of Shawnee, in the State of Kansas.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "9b8e3778-5dec-5638-9047-fd4c4a5cc147",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1254,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:8",
          "start": 1177
        },
        "quote": "Gender. Words importing the masculine gender include the feminine and neuter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "7012fda0-a256-53be-9120-db9194dd3cbf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1342,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:9",
          "start": 1255
        },
        "quote": "Governing Body. The words “Governing Body” mean the Mayor and City Council of the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "103e3b37-57a4-5d7d-b584-b0317f90ee7c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1432,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:10",
          "start": 1343
        },
        "quote": "Health Agency. The words “Health Agency” shall mean the Shawnee County Health Department.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "2fa8dbf0-fbbf-5e98-952a-34e4c03c11d8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1540,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:11",
          "start": 1433
        },
        "quote": "Health Officer. The words “Health Officer” shall mean the Director of the Shawnee County Health Department.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "fa69f3a2-f25d-5d31-bf82-7d2aed4f740b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1845,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:12",
          "start": 1541
        },
        "quote": "In the City. The words “in the City” mean and include any territory within the corporate limits of the City of Topeka, Kansas, and the police jurisdiction thereof, and any other territory over which regulatory power has been conferred on the City by general or special act, except as otherwise specified.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "acb8891f-e182-5a77-b923-a2f4dd3222b8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2021,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:13",
          "start": 1846
        },
        "quote": "Joint Authority. All words giving a joint authority to three or more persons or officers shall be construed as giving such authority to a majority of such persons or officers.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "fdc1c6a2-4c3b-5d82-9979-7d3202eb2a10",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2108,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:14",
          "start": 2022
        },
        "quote": "K.S.A. The abbreviation “K.S.A.” shall mean the Kansas Statutes Annotated, as amended.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "5ba72f1d-28a5-5f7b-8863-fa3c436a1a14",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2214,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:15",
          "start": 2109
        },
        "quote": "Number. Words used in the singular include the plural, and words used in the plural include the singular.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "12c9fdf4-2aa2-5689-8a80-e46c616db4db",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2439,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:16",
          "start": 2215
        },
        "quote": "Oath. The word “oath” includes an affirmation in all cases in which, by law, an affirmation may be substituted for an oath, and in such cases the words “swear” and “sworn” are equivalent to the words “affirm” and “affirmed.”",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "5794dd38-f82c-555b-a71a-717e79c8c0e1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2541,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:17",
          "start": 2440
        },
        "quote": "Or, And. The word “or” may be read as “and,” and the word “and” as “or,” where the sense requires it.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "93e0be38-0972-5b74-9c2b-cb7291fa1542",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2757,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:18",
          "start": 2542
        },
        "quote": "Owner. The word “owner” applied to a building or land shall include not only the owner of the whole, but any part owner, joint owner, tenant in common or joint tenant of the whole or a part of such building or land.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 19",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "fc2562cb-4593-5924-8167-dd260bfa1ace",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2863,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:19",
          "start": 2758
        },
        "quote": "Parkings. The word “parkings” or “parking” shall mean the area between the roadway and right-of-way line.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 20",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 20,
          "component_id": "fe94baed-21b3-5ac5-b043-1227f9b7aa43",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3032,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:20",
          "start": 2864
        },
        "quote": "Person. The word “person” includes a firm, partnership, association of persons, corporation, organization or any other group acting as a unit, as well as an individual.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:20#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 21",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 21,
          "component_id": "7b59a683-dd25-5c0d-accf-886bdb872d6d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3138,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:21",
          "start": 3033
        },
        "quote": "Personal Property. The words “personal property” include every species of property, except real property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:21#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 22",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 22,
          "component_id": "a5eee2cb-255b-53ac-8590-215e540a1e74",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3245,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:22",
          "start": 3139
        },
        "quote": "Preceding, Following. The words “preceding” and “following” mean next before and next after, respectively.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:22#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 23",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 23,
          "component_id": "3afbbe3a-f3a9-5324-a7eb-4c0985384bcd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3319,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:23",
          "start": 3246
        },
        "quote": "Property. The word “property” includes real, personal and mixed property.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:23#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 24",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 24,
          "component_id": "91ae78f1-fce8-570a-8d45-e64ac3de4ba9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3404,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:24",
          "start": 3320
        },
        "quote": "Real Property. The words “real property” include lands, tenements and hereditaments.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:24#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 25",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 25,
          "component_id": "221bb68c-d806-54be-931c-f8496dcb9aa4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3553,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:25",
          "start": 3405
        },
        "quote": "Sidewalk. The word “sidewalk” means any portion of a street between the curbline and the adjacent property line intended for the use of pedestrians.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:25#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 26",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 26,
          "component_id": "ff051fb7-54e6-54c5-9a4c-49c5c55eaf27",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3624,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:26",
          "start": 3554
        },
        "quote": "State. The words “the State” or “this State” mean the State of Kansas.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:26#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 27",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 27,
          "component_id": "d6d91d1e-3112-594d-9eb2-2d12856b6387",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3831,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:27",
          "start": 3625
        },
        "quote": "Street. The word “street” means and includes public streets, avenues, boulevards, highways, roads, alleys, lanes, viaducts, bridges and the approaches thereto and all other public thoroughfares in the City.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:27#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 1.10.020 block 28",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 28,
          "component_id": "478819c9-2860-5ebb-a0d3-701475541514",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4020,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:28",
          "start": 3832
        },
        "quote": "Tenant, Occupant. The words “tenant” and “occupant,” applied to a building or land, mean any person who occupies the whole or a part of such building or land, whether alone or with others.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:1.10.020:block:28#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
